{
  "version": "1.5",
  "last_updated": "2026-05-07",
  "notes": "v1.5 (2026-05-07): LA zone shake-up. Zone IDs renamed to drop people's names (LA-Albert\u2192LA-NORTH, LA-Alex\u2192LA-WEST, LA-Julie\u2192LA-EAST, LA-Zoila\u2192LA-INLAND). Account managers swapped between LA-NORTH and LA-WEST: Alex Acuna now owns the North & High Desert territory (LA-NORTH), and Albert Trevino now owns West Basin & Coast (LA-WEST). 40 LA ZIPs moved into LA-NORTH from LA-WEST (23) and LA-EAST (17), comprising a Westside-Hollywood-Glendale strip from Bel Air east through Burbank. Existing addresses in the Sheet were re-assigned by the Apps Script's migrateZoneIds_() one-time function. TO REASSIGN A ZIP: find it in any zone's array under assignment_rules[0].params.zips, move it to the target zone's array. Order within an array does not matter; the build script sorts them.",
